WEBVTT

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.350
As I just advised you,

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.880
there are lots of dangerous animals in the ocean and mountains.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.380
So, you must be careful, okay?

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.120
Okay!

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.130
Miss Ootani? Miss Ootani?!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.080
Y-Yes?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:25.030
Stop spacing out. Pay attention.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:28.990
Just because summer vacation's here,
that doesn't mean you can zone out.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.430
You want to quit?!

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:43.900
I can understand why.
It's scary beyond belief.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.730
But I can't allow you. They need you.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.160
You can't quit.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.690
Definitely not.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.300
Oh, come on. Only six more months.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.470
Just stick it out for six more months!

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:00.470
Besides, summer vacation's here.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:03.660
Forget about your duties and go and have fun!

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.820
Uh-oh, not good.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.680
— Hey, Kumi?
— Yeah?

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.570
Do you think Yuri is okay?

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.980
I don't think she can handle it any more.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.400
We have to do something.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:33.460
'Cause we've both experienced the same fear she's feeling.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.660
So, you're still planning on using those kids?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:12.830
Yes, because if we use other kids,
we won't make it in time.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.420
Is everything okay? I can't do anything more than this.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.380
I understand. I'll do my best.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.260
I got chewed out.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.220
Ups-a-daisy.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.350
About one month till they're ready.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.020
Well, we have one month.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.510
The girls should be able to bounce back by then!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.760
I can hardly wait!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.460
Yeah! We got it!

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.340
Too cool!

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.040
Let's go and find another one!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.710
Honestly!

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.680
Aren't you ever getting up?!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.830
You gonna sleep your whole summer vacation away?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.260
Stop being so silly.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:25.880
Your friends have come to pick you up.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:27.530
What?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.370
Have a good time!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.030
Huh? What?

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.560
Hurry up, will ya?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:46.300
The train's gonna leave!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.790
— Made it.
— That was close.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:07.610
Don't be such a slowcoach!

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:10.840
Miyu, you have a huge appetite!

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.060
I'm starving!

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:15.300
You'll get fat.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.460
— I'm dying!
— Miyu, are you okay?

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.850
Nice to see you again, Kasumi.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.560
Well then, shall we?

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.660
Thank you for having us!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:01.310
Welcome. Come in and make yourselves at home.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.710
Thanks!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.170
— Wait a second.
— What is it?

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:11.050
Just come here.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.220
Everybody ready?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.300
This is to commemorate our arrival at Kasumi's summer house.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.960
We finally made it.

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:31.110
This is a big summer house.
Do you always come here?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:35.380
Yeah, with my brother. We came here last year too.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.950
Your brother's overseas, right?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.920
Yeah.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:46.380
He's busy this year, so he couldn't make it back.

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:49.340
Really? That's too bad.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.340
Yuri!

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.300
Ta-da!

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:58.340
Wow! Unreal!!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.000
It's beautiful!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.660
It's gorgeous!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:25.980
See, isn't it nice?

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.500
And I'm the one who noticed it!

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.920
From tomorrow on we're gonna do nothing but play!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.500
Yay!

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.230
Hot, hot, hot!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.740
Yuri!

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:51.770
Hurry up!

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:57.110
Miyu! Kumi!

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.740
Yuri! Hurry up!

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.700
Wait.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.120
Hurry up!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:11.250
No, I can't go out that far.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.850
Are you all right?

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.140
I swallowed some salt water.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.850
That was scary!!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:21.700
You're such a chicken! That was such an easy dare!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:25.070
Did you get the orange?

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.920
Of course I did!

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.500
Good.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.410
You're up last, Yuri!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.470
Yuri, good luck!

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.210
It's a snap.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.750
Right! You were just screaming!

00:11:53.880 --> 00:12:07.950
I'm not scared... I'm not scared...

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.650
No! Get away!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:28.830
It's okay, no problem.

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:31.490
The old guy's just playing tricks.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.250
So I'm not scared.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:39.080
I'm not scared. Not one bit.

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.540
— Kumi?

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.120
W-Wait!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:21.080
What's going on?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:28.970
Yuri!

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.600
Kumi!

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:36.330
What happened?

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:40.260
The tree! There's something in the tree!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.980
It's just a flying squirrel!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:52.320
Oh. Ouch.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.740
You had us freaking out.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.870
Hey, don't leave me alone like that.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.670
I was terrified!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.570
Huh? Hey, wait!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:16.520
Kumi!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.110
Yuri!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:30.400
What took ya so long?!
You're gonna be late for school!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:35.370
What? But it's summer vacation.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.290
It's over already.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.180
Over here, Miss Ootani.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:03.680
<i>Everybody, everybody is an alien</i>

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:07.520
<i>Everyone will become an alien</i>

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:11.370
<i>Everybody will become one</i>

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:15.160
<i>All the kids will graduate</i>

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.070
<i>Their bodies will change
They will become adults</i>

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:23.600
<i>And everybody is an alien</i>

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.220
What do I do?! What should I do!

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:48.040
Everybody's become an alien.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.110
Everything's okay.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:55.570
<i>Everybody will become one</i>

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:59.920
<i>All the kids will graduate</i>

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:04.610
<i>Their bodies will change
They will become adults</i>

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:09.290
<i>And everybody is an alien</i>

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:14.410
Miss Ootani! The race is about to start!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.090
You'd better hurry!

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.320
Yuri.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.790
Hurry up, Yuri.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.100
Hurry, hurry!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.050
Did they get wet?

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.070
They look okay.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.730
It'll stop soon.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:19.970
It's almost over.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.430
Summer vacation.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.820
Kumi?

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.700
We're all worried about you.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.110
Kasumi and Miyu are too.

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:50.660
Everybody is.

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:57.110
We'll always be together.

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:59.580
Cause we're friends.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.420
Aren't you ever getting up?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.170
Summer vacation is over!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.530
Hurry and get up.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.030
We'll always be together.

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:46.950
I'll keep trying.

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:56.290
This time we can't make any mistakes.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:00.500
Miyu.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.880
— Good morning.
— Morning.

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:07.340
— Morning, Yuri.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.860
Good morning.

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:23.610
— Good morning.
— Morning.

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:28.130
It's the first day of second term.
You'll be busier than in first term.

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:29.530
So do your best!

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:31.240
Miss Toomine.

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:32.100
Yes!

00:22:32.100 --> 00:22:34.080
Use it gracefully, as you have been.

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:35.790
Miss Kawamura?

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:36.820
Yes.

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:38.750
Use it wisely, as you have been.

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:46.850
This time don't kill it, Miss Ootani.

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:49.820
Okay, everyone.

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:51.890
Let's do our best this term!

00:24:24.890 --> 00:24:25.920
What?

00:24:38.630 --> 00:24:42.270
Everyone stay calm. Nobody panic.

00:24:54.780 --> 00:24:58.430
This alien didn't do anything in the end.

00:24:59.050 --> 00:25:01.310
It's just big and in the way.

00:25:21.650 --> 00:25:24.870
Yellow Knife. A botanical alien.

00:25:25.170 --> 00:25:28.450
It swallows any living creature that approaches as a sample.

00:25:28.450 --> 00:25:30.380
Studies the victims' weaknesses.

00:25:30.380 --> 00:25:34.050
And as a means of self-protection,
it attacks the mind of the victim.

00:25:34.050 --> 00:25:36.840
Parentheses. Edible. Close parentheses.

00:25:39.920 --> 00:25:41.600
This is strange.

00:25:41.600 --> 00:25:44.740
I didn't ask for this.

00:25:44.740 --> 00:25:47.270
I wonder if it got here by attaching itself to a spaceship.

00:25:48.370 --> 00:25:51.610
I haven't even finished checking everyone's summer homework.

00:25:51.610 --> 00:25:54.780
This is the <i>last</i> thing I needed!

00:26:50.620 --> 00:26:54.590
The End
Episode 3:
The End of Summer Vacation – Borg – Death
